"{{Term/Store|The Royal White Stallion||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|The Royal White Stallion}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Outskirt Stable}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
At [[Outskirt Stable]], [[Link]] can meet [[Toffa]], who asks if he has seen a [[White Horse]] on his journeys.<ref>{{Cite|A traveler... Tell me, have you seen a {{Color BotW|Red|pure-white horse}} anywhere?|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> Long ago, his grandfather told him that he saw the White Horse that belonged to the [[Royal Family of Hyrule]] grazing on [[Safula Hill]].<ref>{{Cite|A long time back, my grandfather told me that he once saw the royal family's {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} grazing on {{Color BotW|Blue|Safula Hill}}...|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> Recently, a customer at the Stable also claims to have seen the [[Horse]],<ref>{{Cite|The thing is...just the other day, one of our customers said he saw a {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} on {{Color BotW|Blue|Safula Hill}} recently...|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> which Toffa believes may be a descendant of the original.<ref>{{Cite|Could it be a relative of the royal family's {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} from my grandfather's day?|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> He asks Link to bring him the White Horse if he happens to find it,<ref>{{Cite|Well, if you happen to see a {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} on your travels, do you think you could bring it back to me?|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> in addition to registering it at a Stable.<ref>{{Cite|Thank you! If you see the {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}, please {{Color BotW|Blue|register it}} at a stable and bring it to me.|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> He also warns Link that, while it is a beautiful Horse, it can be difficult to catch.<ref>{{Cite|The {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} on {{Color BotW|Blue|Safula Hill}} supposedly has a beautiful, pure-white coat without any mottling. I hear it's very elusive, though. Good luck.|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> This begins the [[Side Quest]].{{Note|It is possible to begin and end this Side Quest immediately by speaking to Toffa after registering the White Horse. He will be shocked by its presence and the validity of his grandfather's stories.<ref>{{Cite|Oh! You— That {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}! My grandpa's stories were true? The {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} I dreamed of is right before my eyes!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> Toffa then gives Link the Royal Bridle and Royal Saddle.<ref>{{Cite|There's something I'd like to present you with! These are the royal family's saddle and bridle! The royal saddle and bridle are custom fit for this {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref>}}{{Note|If Link tames the White Horse before accepting the Side Quest from Toffa, he will implore Link to register the Horse at the reception desk right away and speak to him after.<ref>{{Cite|Oh! You— That {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}! You can {{Color BotW|Blue|register that beauty}} at this stable's reception desk. Go {{Color BotW|Blue|register}} the {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} and then come right back!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|You can {{Color BotW|Blue|register your horse}} here at the stable's reception desk! Talk to me again after you've {{Color BotW|Blue|registered}} your {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref>}}

As Toffa said, the White Horse can be found near the [[Sanidin Park Ruins]] on Safula Hill. Link requires at least two full [[Stamina Wheel]]s in order to tame the Horse, but once this has been done, he can ride it back to Outskirt Stable.

After registering the White Horse at a Stable, Toffa will grow excited over the fact that his grandfather's stories were true.<ref>{{Cite|What? You brought the royal family's {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}}? Well I'll be... Grandpa wasn't lying!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> He says that Link has made his life worthwhile.<ref>{{Cite|Son, you just made my life. Staying alive in this godforsaken land may just have been worth it after all.|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> As a reward, he gives him the [[Royal Bridle]] and [[Royal Saddle]], which was handed down to him by his grandfather and custom fitted for a White Horse.<ref>{{Cite|I've got a surprise for you. My grandpa handed this down to me, and now I'm handing it down to you. I present to you...the royal family's saddle and bridle! Custom fitted for the white royal horse!|Toffa|BotW}}</ref>

The [[Horse Gear]] is immediately placed upon the White Horse, at which point Toffa recalls the stories his grandfather told him.<ref>{{Cite|The {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} that {{Color BotW|Blue|Princess Zelda}} rode. The one my grandfather told me about when I was little...|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> He heard that the sight of [[Princess Zelda|Zelda]] riding her White Horse was a beauty beyond words,<ref>{{Cite|The sight of the princess riding atop the {{Color BotW|Red|white horse}} was supposed to be a beauty beyond words...|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> and he states that the Horse Link has must be its grandchild.<ref>{{Cite|There's no doubt about it, this {{Color BotW|Red|horse}} is the grandchild of that hose so long ago. So beautiful... So pure...|Toffa|BotW}}</ref> With this, the Side Quest will be complete.

